  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 904.02 Initiation of Investigation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 904.02 Initiation of Investigation. The department shall conduct an investigation into the listed status of a water whenever:\n\n(a) It receives conflicting information from credible sources regarding the status of a water; or\n\n(b) When requested by the attorney general.\n\nSource. #8383, eff 6-22-05; ss by #10417, eff 9-24-13 (from Env-Wr 904.01); ss by #13726, eff 8-19-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
